1
00:00:00,520 --> 00:00:01,280
=You Alone Know Me=

2
00:00:01,280 --> 00:00:03,892
(From the Qimao novel "My Bestie's Icy
Dad Got Drunk and Wild After We Wed")

3
00:00:03,892 --> 00:00:04,920
(Written by Qiaoqiaojiang)

4
00:00:05,120 --> 00:00:08,040
=Episode 3=

5
00:00:19,079 --> 00:00:20,359
What made you buy this place?

6
00:00:20,879 --> 00:00:21,399
Well,

7
00:00:21,559 --> 00:00:23,519
I overheard Dad discussing development,

8
00:00:24,440 --> 00:00:25,679
so I used his connections

9
00:00:25,839 --> 00:00:26,760
to buy this land

10
00:00:26,960 --> 00:00:27,839
and planted roses.

11
00:00:30,600 --> 00:00:32,200
This land belongs to Bao'er,

12
00:00:32,960 --> 00:00:33,719
and she's giving it to you now.

13
00:00:34,240 --> 00:00:35,560
Whether to develop it later

14
00:00:36,079 --> 00:00:36,640
is up to you.

15
00:00:37,920 --> 00:00:39,000
But I...

16
00:00:39,159 --> 00:00:40,399
Didn't you say

17
00:00:40,520 --> 00:00:41,920
you loved Maple Leaf Lake?

18
00:00:43,479 --> 00:00:45,320
What's mine is yours.

19
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:46,799
Dad's stuff is yours, too.

20
00:00:47,119 --> 00:00:48,079
And what's yours stays yours.

21
00:00:52,359 --> 00:00:53,280
You two have a look around.

22
00:00:53,840 --> 00:00:55,079
I've got things to do at the estate.

23
00:00:56,039 --> 00:00:56,479
Okay.

24
00:01:00,240 --> 00:01:00,560
Look.

25
00:01:05,280 --> 00:01:05,879
Hua.

26
00:01:06,640 --> 00:01:07,680
I need to take this call.

27
00:01:16,600 --> 00:01:19,600
♪The breeze feels sweeter today♪

28
00:01:19,840 --> 00:01:23,080
♪Maybe because you're by my side♪

29
00:01:24,480 --> 00:01:26,600
♪With you by my side♪

30
00:01:26,720 --> 00:01:29,960
♪Even cloudy skies turn sunny♪

31
00:01:30,920 --> 00:01:33,080
♪One look at you♪

32
00:01:33,240 --> 00:01:36,400
♪And my heart dares to race♪

33
00:01:40,519 --> 00:01:40,959
Hua.

34
00:01:43,280 --> 00:01:45,439
You've always dreamed of
buying this land.

35
00:01:46,120 --> 00:01:46,680
I've never

36
00:01:47,519 --> 00:01:48,319
forgotten it.

37
00:01:50,680 --> 00:01:51,400
What are you doing here?

38
00:01:54,040 --> 00:01:54,519
Dad.

39
00:01:54,959 --> 00:01:56,000
What are you doing here?

40
00:02:00,760 --> 00:02:03,040
That jerk followed her here?

41
00:02:03,840 --> 00:02:04,280
Dad.

42
00:02:04,840 --> 00:02:05,799
I'll go beat him to a pulp!

43
00:02:06,359 --> 00:02:06,799
Wait.

44
00:02:09,879 --> 00:02:11,280
She can handle it herself.

45
00:02:12,719 --> 00:02:13,560
You befriended Xie Bao'er

46
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:14,680
to get this land.

47
00:02:15,319 --> 00:02:16,240
Are you really happy?

48
00:02:17,240 --> 00:02:18,199
Xie Zhouhan married you

49
00:02:18,520 --> 00:02:19,719
because you're young and pretty,

50
00:02:20,039 --> 00:02:20,759
with no parents.

51
00:02:21,439 --> 00:02:22,759
That makes you easy to control.

52
00:02:23,080 --> 00:02:24,120
Gu Zheng, let go of me!

53
00:02:25,039 --> 00:02:25,960
I'm doing this for your own good.

54
00:02:26,719 --> 00:02:27,639
The Xie family is trouble.

55
00:02:28,039 --> 00:02:28,599
Come home with me.

56
00:02:30,400 --> 00:02:32,439
You're letting him harass Mommy!

57
00:02:34,719 --> 00:02:35,479
We're not here

58
00:02:35,960 --> 00:02:36,919
to stand up for her.

59
00:02:37,560 --> 00:02:38,680
We need her to know

60
00:02:39,360 --> 00:02:40,280
that whatever she decides,

61
00:02:40,759 --> 00:02:41,800
we'll always have her back.

62
00:02:42,360 --> 00:02:42,840
Gu Zheng.

63
00:02:43,560 --> 00:02:45,280
Not everyone's

64
00:02:45,400 --> 00:02:46,360
as scheming and cruel as you think.

65
00:02:47,879 --> 00:02:49,520
Even if he wants something from me,

66
00:02:52,159 --> 00:02:53,759
it's my choice to be with him.

67
00:02:54,759 --> 00:02:55,800
How long have you even known him?

68
00:02:56,360 --> 00:02:57,319
And you trust him that much?

69
00:02:57,800 --> 00:02:58,599
I trust Bao'er.

70
00:03:00,560 --> 00:03:01,479
I was wrong.

71
00:03:02,599 --> 00:03:03,400
I can explain.

72
00:03:03,479 --> 00:03:04,400
I had my reasons.

73
00:03:04,639 --> 00:03:05,319
Your reasons?

74
00:03:07,759 --> 00:03:08,840
You mean

75
00:03:09,479 --> 00:03:11,240
letting me give you my heart

76
00:03:11,759 --> 00:03:12,960
while you got engaged to someone else

77
00:03:13,520 --> 00:03:15,120
and trampled all over my feelings?

78
00:03:15,360 --> 00:03:16,599
Those were your reasons?

79
00:03:19,719 --> 00:03:20,919
Give this to your mommy.

80
00:03:30,759 --> 00:03:31,240
Gu Zheng.

81
00:03:32,800 --> 00:03:34,240
You shattered that glass.

82
00:03:35,159 --> 00:03:36,039
You can't put it back together.

83
00:04:00,599 --> 00:04:01,120
Hua.

84
00:04:03,240 --> 00:04:04,759
That jerk upset you again, didn't he?

85
00:04:06,520 --> 00:04:07,360
I'm fine.

86
00:04:08,639 --> 00:04:09,120
Then why...

87
00:04:11,120 --> 00:04:12,520
I was touching the roses,

88
00:04:12,879 --> 00:04:14,759
and a thorn pricked my hand.

89
00:04:23,199 --> 00:04:23,720
Let's go.

90
00:04:24,319 --> 00:04:25,439
Forget all that misery.

91
00:04:27,079 --> 00:04:29,319
Dad booked us a fancy restaurant.

92
00:04:30,199 --> 00:04:31,000
Let's get some decent food.

93
00:04:33,079 --> 00:04:33,480
Come on.

94
00:04:47,519 --> 00:04:48,160
Mr. Xie.

95
00:04:54,639 --> 00:04:55,360
Have you been drinking?

96
00:04:57,160 --> 00:04:57,639
Business dinner.

97
00:05:00,120 --> 00:05:00,560
Some warm water.

98
00:05:51,840 --> 00:05:53,800
♪Get close to her♪

99
00:05:54,960 --> 00:05:56,720
♪Kiss her♪

100
00:05:56,720 --> 00:05:57,519
Your hair's wet.

101
00:05:58,080 --> 00:06:01,080
♪Close to my heart♪

102
00:06:05,080 --> 00:06:07,040
♪I want to get a little closer♪

103
00:06:08,680 --> 00:06:10,640
♪A little closer still♪

104
00:06:12,040 --> 00:06:14,160
♪Hear her breathing♪

105
00:06:14,360 --> 00:06:16,720
♪Right beside my ear♪

106
00:06:18,959 --> 00:06:20,399
Blow-dry your hair,

107
00:06:20,440 --> 00:06:21,760
♪Close to my heart♪

108
00:06:22,199 --> 00:06:23,040
or you'll get a headache.

109
00:06:23,840 --> 00:06:25,400
♪She sets me alight so easily♪

110
00:06:25,560 --> 00:06:27,280
♪If this means losing control♪

111
00:06:27,400 --> 00:06:29,200
♪I'll gladly be reckless forever♪

112
00:06:29,600 --> 00:06:31,000
♪Don't ask about the future♪

113
00:06:31,160 --> 00:06:32,560
♪Don't ask me why♪

114
00:06:33,440 --> 00:06:35,440
♪No need to make it obvious♪

115
00:06:36,600 --> 00:06:38,600
♪No need for words♪

116
00:06:39,839 --> 00:06:40,439
Go to bed early.

117
00:06:42,160 --> 00:06:44,120
♪Like a speeding train♪

118
00:06:55,519 --> 00:06:57,040
(Why is my heart racing?)

119
00:07:08,199 --> 00:07:09,600
(I almost lost control.)

120
00:07:27,680 --> 00:07:30,640
♪You say you don't need anyone♪
(Signature page, Party A Xie Zhouhan)

121
00:07:31,000 --> 00:07:34,040
♪You're just fine on your own♪

122
00:07:34,360 --> 00:07:37,200
♪I see the pride behind your smile♪

123
00:07:37,320 --> 00:07:40,200
♪And the pain you face at night♪

124
00:07:40,960 --> 00:07:43,880
♪Sometimes love isn't about possession♪

125
00:07:44,280 --> 00:07:47,040
♪It's tenderness that sets you free♪

126
00:07:47,120 --> 00:07:50,120
♪Some love needs no promises♪

127
00:07:50,240 --> 00:07:53,480
♪I'll face this cold world with you♪

128
00:07:53,560 --> 00:07:56,160
♪I keep my feelings safely hidden♪

129
00:07:56,280 --> 00:07:59,400
♪Quietly staying behind you♪

130
00:07:59,600 --> 00:08:02,360
♪I'm right behind you♪

131
00:08:02,720 --> 00:08:05,880
♪Shielding you from every hidden storm♪

132
00:08:05,960 --> 00:08:08,520
♪Keeping the rain out of your eyes♪

133
00:08:08,520 --> 00:08:12,520
♪So you can walk ahead without fear♪

134
00:08:15,520 --> 00:08:18,720
♪I'm right behind you♪

135
00:08:18,880 --> 00:08:20,600
♪Waiting for you to turn around♪

136
00:08:20,720 --> 00:08:22,440
♪Waiting for you to finally see♪

137
00:08:22,520 --> 00:08:24,880
♪You're the only one I lose control for♪

138
00:08:25,080 --> 00:08:26,440
♪I'm right behind you♪

139
00:08:26,520 --> 00:08:28,800
♪Loving you gently, though no one knows♪

140
00:08:28,920 --> 00:08:30,560
♪I won't claim you♪

141
00:08:30,680 --> 00:08:32,240
♪I won't ask you to stay♪

142
00:08:32,360 --> 00:08:34,920
♪I'll spend the rest of my life♪

143
00:08:35,960 --> 00:08:38,280
♪Waiting for you♪
